<template>
  <section>
    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">With Image</h2>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted"><code>src</code> for image. Falls back to initials on error.</p>

    <div class="demo-row">
      <pdx-avatar src="/avatars/person-1.svg" alt="Jane Doe"></pdx-avatar>
      <pdx-avatar src="/avatars/person-2.svg" alt="Alex Smith"></pdx-avatar>
      <pdx-avatar src="/avatars/person-3.svg" alt="Mary Kim"></pdx-avatar>
      <pdx-avatar src="/missing-avatar.jpg" alt="Error Fallback"></pdx-avatar>
    </div>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-xs)">
      The last one points at a file this site does not have — falls back to initials with auto color.
    </p>

    <details class="source-block">
      <summary>Source</summary>
      <pre class="pdx-txt-mono"><code>&lt;pdx-avatar src="/avatars/person-1.svg" alt="Jane Doe"&gt;&lt;/pdx-avatar&gt;
&lt;pdx-avatar src="/missing-avatar.jpg" alt="Error Fallback"&gt;&lt;/pdx-avatar&gt;  &lt;!-- shows "EF" --&gt;</code></pre>
    </details>
